WEBVTT

00:00:05.733 --> 00:00:07.813
Agh! Shoot!

00:00:07.893 --> 00:00:11.013
[Darrell] Boogity, boogity, boogity,
boys! Let's go racin'!

00:00:14.653 --> 00:00:17.173
[crowd cheering]

00:00:17.253 --> 00:00:18.853
Come on, you can do it!

00:00:18.893 --> 00:00:20.933
Come on, King, make us proud, boy!

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:25.373
[Bob] Fifty laps down, and The King
is still holding a slim lead.

00:00:25.413 --> 00:00:28.653
[Darrell] McQueen's got a run on him!
He's lookin' to the inside!

00:00:30.813 --> 00:00:33.013
Oh! Chick slammed the door on him!

00:00:33.093 --> 00:00:35.453
[Bob] Chick's not
making it easy on him today.

00:00:35.533 --> 00:00:37.253
[Darrell] He lost momentum,

00:00:37.333 --> 00:00:39.613
and now he's gonna have to
chase him back down!

00:00:43.533 --> 00:00:46.533
- [soft music]
- [birds singing]

00:00:47.893 --> 00:00:48.973
[breaks squealing]

00:00:49.053 --> 00:00:51.093
[Bob] McQueen spins out in the infield!

00:00:51.173 --> 00:00:52.213
[all gasp]

00:00:55.093 --> 00:00:57.693
[chuckling] Just me
and the old man, fellas.

00:00:57.773 --> 00:01:01.253
- McQueen just doesn't have it today.
- [all laugh]

00:01:01.373 --> 00:01:02.413
[groans]

00:01:02.453 --> 00:01:06.533
- Hey, kid, are you all right?
- I don't know, Mack.

00:01:06.613 --> 00:01:08.053
I don't think I...

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:10.813
[Doc] I didn't come all this way
to see you quit.

00:01:11.093 --> 00:01:12.613
Doc?

00:01:15.293 --> 00:01:17.933
Guys, you're here!
I can't believe this!

00:01:17.973 --> 00:01:21.733
I knew you needed a crew chief,
but I didn't know it was this bad.

00:01:21.813 --> 00:01:23.733
You said you'd never come back.

00:01:23.813 --> 00:01:27.373
Well, I really didn't have a choice.
Mater didn't get to say goodbye.

00:01:27.453 --> 00:01:30.333
Goodbye! OK, I'm good.

00:01:30.413 --> 00:01:32.293
[chuckles]

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:37.813
All right, if you can drive as good
as you can fix a road

00:01:37.893 --> 00:01:41.133
then you can win this race
with your eyes shut.

00:01:41.253 --> 00:01:43.253
Now, get back out there!

00:01:45.493 --> 00:01:48.453
Hot snot, we are back in business!
Guido! Luigi!

00:01:48.493 --> 00:01:50.813
You're goin' up
against professional pit crews.

00:01:50.853 --> 00:01:54.053
- You're gonna have to be fast.
- They will not know what bit them!

00:01:54.133 --> 00:01:55.813
Kid, you can beat these guys.

00:01:55.853 --> 00:01:59.293
Find a groove that works for you
and get that lap back.

00:02:08.493 --> 00:02:10.933
[murmuring]

00:02:11.013 --> 00:02:12.893
- Is it?
- Oh, wow. That's him!

00:02:12.973 --> 00:02:16.733
Is that...? That's the Hudson Hornet!
The Hudson Hornet's back!

00:02:16.813 --> 00:02:19.453
[Bob] It appears McQueen
has got himself a pit crew.

00:02:19.533 --> 00:02:21.893
And look who he has for a crew chief!

00:02:21.973 --> 00:02:24.693
- Look, man. It's the Hudson Hornet!
- Whoa!

00:02:24.733 --> 00:02:28.053
Well, dip me in axle grease
and call me Slick! It surely is.

00:02:30.533 --> 00:02:32.653
[crowd cheering]

00:02:32.693 --> 00:02:34.733
[Bob] Wow, this is history
in the making.

00:02:34.813 --> 00:02:37.693
Nobody has seen the racing legend
in over 50 years!

00:02:37.773 --> 00:02:39.213
Hey, Doc!

00:02:39.253 --> 00:02:43.413
Come look at this fellow on the radio.
He looks just like you.

00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:52.133
- [Bob] McQueen passes on the inside!
- [Darrell] He's nearly a lap down.

00:02:52.213 --> 00:02:55.093
[Bob] Can he catch up to them
with only 60 laps to go?

00:02:55.173 --> 00:02:58.053
You're goin' great, kid.
Just keep your head on.

00:02:58.133 --> 00:02:59.733
Vai! Vai, vai!

00:02:59.813 --> 00:03:02.733
Hey, shrimpie,
where did McQueen find you, huh?

00:03:02.773 --> 00:03:06.213
Those round things are called tires,
and they go under the car!

00:03:06.293 --> 00:03:07.333
[all laugh]

00:03:07.413 --> 00:03:09.973
Con chi credi di parlare?
Ma, con chi stai parlando?

00:03:10.053 --> 00:03:13.253
No! No, no! You'll have your chance.
You will have your chance.

00:03:27.653 --> 00:03:30.453
Oh, kid's just tryin'
to be a hero, huh?

00:03:32.053 --> 00:03:33.293
What do you think of this?

00:03:33.373 --> 00:03:35.573
- [tires squealing]
- Yeah, that's it, kid.

00:03:38.853 --> 00:03:40.133
What?

00:03:40.213 --> 00:03:42.013
Whoa! Git-R-done!

00:03:43.773 --> 00:03:48.053
- [laughing] I taught him that. Ka-chow!
- Ah!

00:03:48.093 --> 00:03:51.093
[Bob] What a move by McQueen!
He's caught up to the leaders.

00:03:51.173 --> 00:03:52.973
Yeah. This is what it's all about.

00:03:53.093 --> 00:03:56.253
A three-way battle for the lead,
with ten to go!

00:03:59.853 --> 00:04:03.093
[chortling]
Look at that boy go out there!

00:04:08.813 --> 00:04:11.093
[Chick] Oh! [grunting]

00:04:12.013 --> 00:04:13.573
No, you don't.

00:04:14.733 --> 00:04:16.613
[tire blows]

00:04:16.653 --> 00:04:18.653
Doc, I'm flat! I'm flat!

00:04:18.733 --> 00:04:22.133
- Can you get back to the pits?
- Yeah, yeah. I think so.

00:04:22.213 --> 00:04:25.533
Hey, got a yellow. Bring it in.
Don't tear yourself up, kid.

00:04:27.493 --> 00:04:29.613
[Mack] We gotta get him
back out there fast

00:04:29.653 --> 00:04:32.613
or we're gonna be a lap down,
and we'll never win this race!

00:04:32.653 --> 00:04:34.813
Guido! It's time.

00:04:39.133 --> 00:04:42.213
Hey, tiny,
you gonna clean his windshield?

00:04:44.853 --> 00:04:47.333
[air wrench whirring]

00:04:51.333 --> 00:04:52.773
[Darrell] I don't believe it!

00:04:52.853 --> 00:04:54.493
[Bob] That was
the fastest pit stop I've ever seen!

00:04:54.613 --> 00:04:57.173
[Darrell] It was a great stop,
but he's still gotta beat that pace car!

00:04:57.213 --> 00:04:58.933
[Bob] It's gonna be close.

00:05:00.613 --> 00:05:03.053
- Yeah, baby!
- [all hollering]

00:05:03.133 --> 00:05:04.533
[Darrell] He's back in!

00:05:05.853 --> 00:05:06.853
Peet stop.

00:05:08.293 --> 00:05:10.173
- Guido, you did it!
- Way to go, Guido!

